WEBVTT

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:09.550
The Day of Parting

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:09.550
The Strongest Enemy - Tohma!

00:00:06.180 --> 00:00:07.640
The Day of Parting!

00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:09.550
The Strongest Enemy - Tohma!

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:15.890
ElDoradimon and the others were duped by Kurata and transported to the human world.

00:00:17.150 --> 00:00:22.390
Masaru and Agumon fought with Darkdramon, Kouki's new form, and came out victorious.

00:00:23.320 --> 00:00:28.020
However, with nothing to defend it, ElDoradimon was annihilated.

00:00:30.010 --> 00:00:31.020
Master Tohma.

00:00:31.020 --> 00:00:32.320
We've come for you.

00:00:35.760 --> 00:00:36.660
Tohma?

00:00:37.150 --> 00:00:38.870
What are you doing, Tohma?

00:00:39.530 --> 00:00:41.740
TOHMA!

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:54.560
The government has assembled an emergency committee to discuss countermeasures to be taken against the Digimon.

00:00:54.560 --> 00:00:59.410
Meanwhile, the police have reason to believe that those responsible for using Digimon to cause this destruction have gone into hiding within the city,

00:00:59.410 --> 00:01:01.670
and are currently investigating the matter.

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:15.440
This is a secret base, right?

00:01:15.760 --> 00:01:18.160
The Captain told us its location a long time ago.

00:01:18.630 --> 00:01:21.370
He said we should use it during emergencies.

00:01:21.760 --> 00:01:27.980
All related government ministries have followed up on the Digimon reports with warnings to the public.

00:01:27.980 --> 00:01:31.420
Damn it, what's Tohma doing at a time like this?

00:01:31.910 --> 00:01:34.160
I'll try calling him one more time.

00:01:35.360 --> 00:01:36.520
Come to think of it,

00:01:36.520 --> 00:01:41.130
didn't that helicopter have the crest of the Norstein family on it?

00:01:41.130 --> 00:01:42.350
You mean Tohma's?

00:01:42.350 --> 00:01:42.780
Yeah.

00:01:42.780 --> 00:01:44.310
I wonder if something happened.

00:01:45.130 --> 00:01:46.000
No good.

00:01:46.610 --> 00:01:49.000
He's not picking up at all.

00:01:52.670 --> 00:01:55.070
Will Tohma come back?

00:01:55.440 --> 00:01:56.980
Of course.

00:01:56.980 --> 00:01:59.240
He's not the kind of guy who abandons his comrades.

00:02:00.280 --> 00:02:01.520
Yeah...

00:02:01.520 --> 00:02:04.490
I'm sure he has his reasons.

00:02:09.790 --> 00:02:11.060
Aniki...

00:02:11.060 --> 00:02:12.750
I'm hungry...

00:02:14.250 --> 00:02:17.110
I can't... take much more...

00:02:18.050 --> 00:02:20.840
C'mon, why are you always like this?

00:02:20.840 --> 00:02:22.790
Let me eat something...

00:02:22.790 --> 00:02:23.900
Now?

00:02:23.900 --> 00:02:25.180
There's nothing!

00:02:44.480 --> 00:02:45.690
Brother!

00:02:50.580 --> 00:02:51.540
Relena!

00:02:52.570 --> 00:02:53.700
Welcome home.

00:02:58.740 --> 00:03:00.990
Relena, why are you in Japan?

00:03:00.990 --> 00:03:02.750
How's your health?

00:03:03.510 --> 00:03:06.230
Father brought me here.

00:03:06.230 --> 00:03:09.360
He said I could be cured.

00:03:12.510 --> 00:03:14.630
You must be Gaomon.

00:03:14.630 --> 00:03:16.650
Pleased to meet you, Miss Relena.

00:03:18.910 --> 00:03:20.340
You're so soft.

00:03:20.990 --> 00:03:22.520
Don't you feel hot?

00:03:22.520 --> 00:03:24.240
O-Only a little during the summertime.

00:03:24.660 --> 00:03:25.490
What about your nose?

00:03:28.750 --> 00:03:30.730
It's wet.

00:03:30.730 --> 00:03:32.080
You're like a real dog.

00:03:33.720 --> 00:03:35.360
Can we be friends?

00:03:39.810 --> 00:03:42.220
O-Of course, Miss Relena!

00:03:42.760 --> 00:03:44.310
Thank you, Gaomon!

00:03:45.730 --> 00:03:46.540
Relena.

00:03:47.410 --> 00:03:50.530
I'm just feeling so happy, I couldn't help it...

00:03:50.530 --> 00:03:52.890
The two of you, come inside!

00:03:57.490 --> 00:03:58.190
Here.

00:03:59.010 --> 00:04:01.030
Thank you, Brother.

00:04:04.380 --> 00:04:06.370
It's been awhile, Father.

00:04:07.550 --> 00:04:11.500
After hearing that you returned to Japan without a word, I find this.

00:04:13.670 --> 00:04:15.460
Anyway, let's talk inside.

00:04:17.360 --> 00:04:19.380
Relena, go back to your room.

00:04:19.380 --> 00:04:22.440
I want to talk a little longer with Brother.

00:04:23.060 --> 00:04:26.170
You must rest or you'll get a fever again.

00:04:26.170 --> 00:04:27.420
But...

00:04:27.420 --> 00:04:29.110
Tohma won't be going anywhere.

00:04:29.110 --> 00:04:31.040
Set yourself at ease.

00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:31.770
Really?

00:04:32.900 --> 00:04:33.730
Yeah.

00:04:35.150 --> 00:04:36.190
Okay then!

00:04:36.720 --> 00:04:39.390
I'll see you later, Brother.

00:04:42.010 --> 00:04:45.090
I don't like this approach of yours.

00:04:45.090 --> 00:04:46.230
What do you mean?

00:04:46.230 --> 00:04:48.370
Please don't exploit her for your own needs.

00:04:48.370 --> 00:04:49.340
Exploit her?

00:04:49.340 --> 00:04:50.880
I'm her father.

00:04:51.610 --> 00:04:53.880
What's wrong about me thinking for my own children?

00:04:56.660 --> 00:05:01.730
You didn't do anything when both Mom and I were suffering, so why now...?

00:05:12.950 --> 00:05:14.980
Welcome home, Tohma-kun.

00:06:18.120 --> 00:06:20.000
Welcome home, Tohma-kun.

00:06:21.240 --> 00:06:22.380
Why?

00:06:22.780 --> 00:06:26.600
Doctor Kurata is watching over Relena's health now.

00:06:26.600 --> 00:06:27.300
Relena?

00:06:27.830 --> 00:06:31.420
I've already given treatment to a number of medical cases.

00:06:31.420 --> 00:06:34.660
I'm confident that I can also cure Relena-chan's illness.

00:06:34.660 --> 00:06:36.060
What are you thinking?

00:06:38.300 --> 00:06:41.950
I will help your little sister, Relena-chan.

00:06:41.950 --> 00:06:45.950
In exchange, your intellect will help me.

00:06:45.950 --> 00:06:48.990
I want us to make a fair deal.

00:06:49.370 --> 00:06:51.120
A deal?!

00:06:51.120 --> 00:06:52.510
Don't, Gaomon.

00:06:58.800 --> 00:07:00.950
You can cure Relena, right?

00:07:00.950 --> 00:07:03.290
Of course.

00:07:03.290 --> 00:07:05.410
Let's hear what you have to say.

00:07:11.770 --> 00:07:13.800
I hope it tastes good.

00:07:14.530 --> 00:07:16.870
I made the onigiri!

00:07:17.350 --> 00:07:17.850
Here!

00:07:22.030 --> 00:07:23.730
Now, eat up!

00:07:22.030 --> 00:07:23.730
Now, eat up!

00:07:23.730 --> 00:07:25.760
Let's eat!

00:07:23.730 --> 00:07:25.760
Let's eat!

00:07:25.760 --> 00:07:26.860
Hold it!

00:07:28.160 --> 00:07:29.130
What is it?

00:07:29.130 --> 00:07:30.930
In this world, it's survival of the fittest.

00:07:30.930 --> 00:07:32.320
The fastest wins!

00:07:32.510 --> 00:07:33.530
Not that!

00:07:33.980 --> 00:07:36.830
Why are Chika and Mom here with us?!

00:07:37.800 --> 00:07:39.040
Because I called them.

00:07:39.690 --> 00:07:41.500
Because I said we'll come.

00:07:42.090 --> 00:07:42.860
Er...

00:07:43.710 --> 00:07:46.020
Do you understand the position we're in?!

00:07:47.090 --> 00:07:51.900
Right now, the Digimon are made out to be evil guys that'll hurt the humans.

00:07:51.900 --> 00:07:53.010
All of us...

00:07:54.250 --> 00:07:56.300
are being regarded as fugitives here!

00:07:57.570 --> 00:07:58.510
It's all right.

00:08:01.360 --> 00:08:02.830
No matter what happens,

00:08:02.830 --> 00:08:04.960
you'll always be my son, Masaru.

00:08:08.450 --> 00:08:09.930
Aniki!

00:08:09.930 --> 00:08:12.240
The fried eggs taste so good!

00:08:12.560 --> 00:08:13.890
You guys!

00:08:13.890 --> 00:08:15.730
You took advantage while I was looking away!

00:08:16.510 --> 00:08:18.680
Damn it, I'm not gonna lose!

00:08:22.190 --> 00:08:24.330
Masaru-niichan, don't push yourself too hard.

00:08:24.880 --> 00:08:26.370
What are you talking about?

00:08:26.370 --> 00:08:29.980
As long as Tohma's gone, I've gotta work harder to pick up the slack!

00:08:29.980 --> 00:08:33.240
I'm worried because he's not around to stop you.

00:08:45.020 --> 00:08:46.300
BanchouLeomon!

00:08:45.020 --> 00:08:46.300
BanchouLeomon!

00:08:47.420 --> 00:08:49.690
It's been a long time, Masaru.

00:08:49.690 --> 00:08:50.750
Agumon.

00:08:52.460 --> 00:08:53.890
Banchou...?

00:09:00.780 --> 00:09:02.390
Now do you understand, Tohma?

00:09:02.390 --> 00:09:06.540
You must cooperate with Doctor Kurata for Relena's sake.

00:09:06.540 --> 00:09:09.440
I will be the one to decide what to do with my own life.

00:09:09.440 --> 00:09:11.100
Not that again!

00:09:11.100 --> 00:09:12.700
Think about your situation!

00:09:12.700 --> 00:09:15.120
I will not forgive you if you return to DATS!

00:09:15.660 --> 00:09:17.500
Why don't you say what you're really thinking?

00:09:17.500 --> 00:09:21.550
That you just don't want me doing anything that'll disgrace the family name!

00:09:21.970 --> 00:09:22.930
What?!

00:09:23.410 --> 00:09:25.420
You were always like this!

00:09:25.420 --> 00:09:28.560
Even when Mom needed your help, you...!

00:09:28.560 --> 00:09:30.420
Now, now, you two.

00:09:30.420 --> 00:09:31.920
Calm yourselves!

00:09:35.560 --> 00:09:36.940
Tohma-kun.

00:09:36.940 --> 00:09:42.390
In the end, all that DATS's methods succeeded in doing was increasing damage that could've been avoided.

00:09:44.220 --> 00:09:51.760
That small bit of justice you've waved around all this time only brought pain and sadness along with it.

00:09:51.760 --> 00:09:53.130
Am I wrong?

00:09:54.500 --> 00:09:56.660
Above all, there is Daimon Masaru.

00:09:56.660 --> 00:10:00.000
Thanks to him, the situation becomes even worse.

00:10:02.980 --> 00:10:04.430
<i>This is a trap!</i>

00:10:04.920 --> 00:10:06.730
<i>I don't care!</i>

00:10:06.730 --> 00:10:08.980
<i>As long as Kurata's defeated, the fight will end!</i>

00:10:08.980 --> 00:10:10.980
<i>Words of a true hero!</i>

00:10:12.730 --> 00:10:15.170
<i>Why doesn't anyone understand?</i>

00:10:16.850 --> 00:10:18.860
I foresee great things from you.

00:10:19.500 --> 00:10:23.990
If you and I join forces, we can end this war...

00:10:24.270 --> 00:10:28.540
and we can create a new world.

00:10:30.080 --> 00:10:32.030
A new world...

00:10:33.830 --> 00:10:34.900
What do you think?

00:10:34.900 --> 00:10:36.630
Will you help me?

00:10:42.320 --> 00:10:45.220
Brother, have you finished talking yet?

00:10:51.080 --> 00:10:52.260
Brother...

00:10:57.760 --> 00:11:00.980
What I wish for... is a peaceful world.

00:11:01.570 --> 00:11:04.990
This must be made into reality as quickly as possible.

00:11:12.440 --> 00:11:15.590
Let's create a new world together.

00:11:21.570 --> 00:11:25.100
Well then, there is a favor I'd like to ask of you without delay.

00:11:28.500 --> 00:11:29.720
I see...

00:11:30.070 --> 00:11:33.020
You couldn't save ElDoradimon...

00:11:33.520 --> 00:11:35.660
But this isn't over yet.

00:11:35.660 --> 00:11:39.440
We'll definitely get much, much stronger and bring Kurata down!

00:11:39.980 --> 00:11:40.920
Yeah!

00:11:40.920 --> 00:11:44.750
We even got a new weapon using the power from the Digivice!

00:11:44.750 --> 00:11:46.270
The GeoGrey Sword!

00:11:47.400 --> 00:11:48.660
As long as we have that...

00:11:48.660 --> 00:11:52.040
There's something I must tell you guys.

00:11:53.760 --> 00:12:00.530
That Digivice has the ability to pull out an absolute power that is far greater than the GeoGrey Sword.

00:12:00.530 --> 00:12:02.420
Its name is "Burst Mode."

00:12:03.020 --> 00:12:04.870
Burst Mode?

00:12:04.870 --> 00:12:05.930
What's that?

00:12:06.690 --> 00:12:09.730
But Burst Mode is a double-edged sword.

00:12:09.730 --> 00:12:11.290
If you make a mistake in using it,

00:12:11.290 --> 00:12:14.760
you will be swallowed up by its dreadful energy and be destroyed.

00:12:14.760 --> 00:12:16.100
Be destroyed...

00:12:16.780 --> 00:12:17.800
Listen.

00:12:17.800 --> 00:12:21.570
You must never use the power of the Burst Mode.

00:12:22.140 --> 00:12:24.440
For your own sakes.

00:12:30.260 --> 00:12:31.640
A Digimon signal!

00:12:31.640 --> 00:12:32.860
It's Piccolomon!

00:12:32.860 --> 00:12:34.120
He's close by!

00:12:34.980 --> 00:12:37.670
There's still someone from the Holy Capital who survived!

00:12:38.000 --> 00:12:39.290
Let's go help him!

00:12:46.940 --> 00:12:47.640
There!

00:12:50.800 --> 00:12:51.710
Gizmon!

00:12:51.710 --> 00:12:53.430
Kurata sniffed him out!

00:13:04.910 --> 00:13:05.950
Now they've done it!

00:13:10.720 --> 00:13:12.680
Don't underestimate me!

00:13:15.860 --> 00:13:16.950
Let's go!

00:13:16.950 --> 00:13:18.170
Yeah!

00:13:16.950 --> 00:13:18.170
Yeah!

00:13:21.420 --> 00:13:23.720
Digisoul Charge!

00:13:23.720 --> 00:13:24.970
Overdrive!

00:13:25.890 --> 00:13:27.440
Agumon, evolve!

00:13:38.920 --> 00:13:40.610
ShineGreymon!

00:13:43.890 --> 00:13:45.940
Digisoul Charge!

00:13:45.940 --> 00:13:47.190
Overdrive!

00:13:48.110 --> 00:13:49.420
Lalamon, evolve!

00:14:04.380 --> 00:14:05.410
Rosemon!

00:14:06.200 --> 00:14:07.370
Digisoul...

00:14:11.610 --> 00:14:13.290
Full Charge!

00:14:15.920 --> 00:14:17.320
Falcomon, evolve!

00:14:32.800 --> 00:14:34.120
Yatagaramon!

00:14:47.580 --> 00:14:49.180
Glorious Burst!

00:14:55.140 --> 00:14:56.730
Glorious Burst!

00:15:05.070 --> 00:15:07.270
Aniki, the GeoGrey Sword...!

00:15:07.840 --> 00:15:08.900
Damn it.

00:15:08.900 --> 00:15:10.360
How do I bring it out?

00:15:14.430 --> 00:15:16.030
Mikafutsu-no-kami!

00:15:18.170 --> 00:15:19.040
Rosemon!

00:15:19.040 --> 00:15:20.100
Yatagaramon!

00:15:22.430 --> 00:15:24.470
Shining Blast!

00:15:26.580 --> 00:15:27.480
All right!

00:15:27.480 --> 00:15:29.250
Go, ShineGreymon!

00:15:35.940 --> 00:15:36.680
Tohma!

00:15:37.510 --> 00:15:39.770
You're late, jerk!

00:15:39.770 --> 00:15:41.370
What were you doing?

00:15:45.950 --> 00:15:47.900
Digisoul Charge!

00:15:47.900 --> 00:15:49.220
Overdrive!

00:15:50.590 --> 00:15:51.760
Gaomon, evolve!

00:16:05.310 --> 00:16:07.290
MirageGaogamon!

00:16:10.340 --> 00:16:11.540
MirageGaogamon!

00:16:11.540 --> 00:16:13.570
C'mon, let's defeat the Gizmon!

00:16:17.850 --> 00:16:19.640
Go, MirageGaogamon.

00:16:20.040 --> 00:16:21.250
Yes, Master.

00:16:30.410 --> 00:16:32.050
What are you doing?!

00:16:32.990 --> 00:16:34.950
This isn't the time to be playing around!

00:16:40.280 --> 00:16:41.910
I am not playing around.

00:16:43.530 --> 00:16:44.250
Tohma!

00:16:44.770 --> 00:16:46.100
What are you doing?

00:16:46.100 --> 00:16:48.210
Make MirageGaogamon stop right now!

00:16:50.880 --> 00:16:53.670
As long as you're around, this fight won't end.

00:16:55.830 --> 00:16:56.430
I...

00:16:57.120 --> 00:16:58.220
will defeat you.

00:16:58.510 --> 00:16:59.430
What?!

00:17:02.310 --> 00:17:03.320
Tohma!

00:17:03.320 --> 00:17:04.350
Stop!

00:17:10.020 --> 00:17:12.830
Just when I thought you'd finally come back...

00:17:12.830 --> 00:17:15.220
What do you mean, Tohma?!

00:17:18.220 --> 00:17:19.780
Quit fooling around!

00:17:25.490 --> 00:17:26.330
I...

00:17:27.070 --> 00:17:30.170
will make a peaceful world together with Professor Kurata!

00:17:31.630 --> 00:17:34.780
With... Kurata...?

00:17:42.370 --> 00:17:44.520
Have you gone insane, Tohma?

00:17:44.920 --> 00:17:47.060
I'm always perfectly level-headed,

00:17:47.060 --> 00:17:47.980
Daimon Masaru!

00:18:06.560 --> 00:18:08.920
Full Moon Blaster!

00:18:10.260 --> 00:18:12.440
Are you okay with that?!

00:18:13.170 --> 00:18:14.880
I simply obey my master!

00:18:16.750 --> 00:18:18.420
I've lost respect for you!

00:18:18.420 --> 00:18:20.110
Shining Blast!

00:18:20.800 --> 00:18:22.090
Gale Claw!

00:18:27.500 --> 00:18:30.040
Why are those two fighting?

00:18:31.150 --> 00:18:35.440
The way you only use brute strength and spirit for everything isn't going to protect anybody, and it certainly won't save them.

00:18:38.410 --> 00:18:40.230
Listen to me very carefully!

00:18:40.230 --> 00:18:41.570
You can't do anything!

00:18:42.090 --> 00:18:43.030
Anything at all!

00:18:52.740 --> 00:18:57.340
I am here... to prove that.

00:18:59.650 --> 00:19:00.950
Why...

00:19:00.950 --> 00:19:03.590
Why are Masaru-niichan and Tohma-kun...?

00:19:05.640 --> 00:19:06.540
Tohma...

00:19:07.540 --> 00:19:09.330
What fun,

00:19:09.330 --> 00:19:12.140
seeing two people fight amidst ignorant adolescence.

00:19:13.130 --> 00:19:14.520
It's truly magnificent!

00:19:20.450 --> 00:19:22.210
Glorious Burst!

00:19:23.620 --> 00:19:25.900
Full Moon Blaster!

00:19:33.050 --> 00:19:34.480
Gale Claw!

00:19:56.760 --> 00:19:58.470
Cut the crap...

00:19:59.040 --> 00:20:01.120
Enough of this bullshit!

00:20:02.770 --> 00:20:04.120
Then...

00:20:04.120 --> 00:20:09.110
What was it that we've been doing all this time?

00:20:10.050 --> 00:20:12.180
Do you need an answer?

00:20:12.180 --> 00:20:14.290
We have nothing else to talk about!

00:20:18.510 --> 00:20:20.010
STOP!

00:20:45.750 --> 00:20:47.940
Unforgivable...

00:20:49.120 --> 00:20:50.370
Tohma...

00:20:50.370 --> 00:20:54.800
You are completely unforgivable!

00:20:56.450 --> 00:20:57.870
That Digisoul...

00:21:07.070 --> 00:21:08.340
What is that?

00:21:24.430 --> 00:21:26.450
Is that Burst Mode?

00:21:28.080 --> 00:21:29.030
No.

00:21:29.030 --> 00:21:30.140
It can't be...

