ShineGreymon's new look...

00:22:39.110 --> 00:22:40.590
Is that Burst Mode?

00:22:40.590 --> 00:22:41.640
No, it's not.

00:22:41.640 --> 00:22:44.870
That is something drawn out from the power of your anger.

00:22:44.870 --> 00:22:45.650
But!

00:22:45.650 --> 00:22:48.280
You must pay a heavy price for using that power!

00:22:48.280 --> 00:22:49.440
You're joking, right?

00:22:49.440 --> 00:22:52.380
Why did Agumon turn back into a Digiegg?

00:22:52.380 --> 00:22:54.480
Damn it!

00:22:54.480 --> 00:22:56.020
Digimon Savers:

00:22:56.020 --> 00:22:57.190
Disastrous Power!

00:22:57.190 --> 00:22:59.060
ShineGreymon Runs Wild!

00:22:59.060 --> 00:23:01.610
Awaken in my fist, Digisoul!

00:23:02.710 --> 00:23:05.320
Disastrous Power

00:23:02.710 --> 00:23:05.320
ShineGreymon Runs Wild
